        "original_id": "79aaa169-db1a-503b-9dac-1327df51eaa4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Karel Bossart, Sergei Korolev\n- Products: Atlas ICBM, R-7 Booster Rocket, Sputnik\n- Events: Laika launch, first human spaceflight\n\nFacts:\n- Karel Bossart was born on February 9, 1904, and he became a pioneering rocket designer.\n- Sergei Korolev was involved in the development of the R-7 Booster Rocket and Sputnik.\n- Sergei Korolev was involved in launching Laika and the first human being into space.\n- Karel Bossart created the Atlas ICBM.\n- Karel Bossart died on August 3, 1975.",
